sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant T as Transport + scope gate
  participant AZ as authz.evaluate
  participant H as Handler + egress guard
  participant X as Cluster / Capella
  C->>T: tools/call
  T->>T: resolve claims, check required scope
  T-->>C: denied_scope
  T->>AZ: evaluate(tool, args, human_present)
  Note over AZ: 1 hard ceiling - first, unconditional<br/>2 read-only mode<br/>3 confirm:true OR automation scope
  AZ-->>C: denied_ceiling | denied_read_only | denied_confirmation
  AZ->>H: allowed - control fields stripped
  Note over H: dry run? preview, no IO
  H->>H: egress guard on any caller destination
  H-->>C: EgressDenied
  H->>X: REST / v4 / SDK call
  X-->>H: response
  H-->>C: ok() redacted | err() redacted
  Note over C,X: one audit record emitted per decision,<br/>whatever the decision was
